{"id":"442974","name":"淮山银耳红薯糖水","author":"緣豆兒","authorId":"8471333","desc":"","cover":"images/442974/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鲜淮山","amount":"1段"},{"name":"银耳","amount":"15克"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好材料。","img":"images/442974/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"银耳提前用水泡软。","img":"images/442974/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红薯去皮切块，用清水泡3一会。","img":"images/442974/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"山药去皮洗净切块，如果不马上用先清水里泡着。","img":"images/442974/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"泡好的银耳去蒂洗净，撕小朵。","img":"images/442974/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"银耳放入锅中，加适量水先煮30分钟。","img":"images/442974/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入红薯和山药，再煮半小时。","img":"images/442974/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后加入冰糖煮化即可。","img":"images/442974/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}